---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About Civilized Rides</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-stone">
      <p class="mb-6">
        Civilized Rides is a curated collection of bike routes around the Boston area. Routes start from a square or other landmark in the Boston area, and they usually end at either a coffee shop or a place to get beers.
        Civilized Rides meet a few key criteria:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc list-inside my-6">
        <li>They provide a challenging workout - some nice climbs and roads where you can drop the hammer</li>
        <li>They prioritize loops over out-and-back routes: There's nothing more uncivilized than retracing your steps.</li> 
        <li>Most of the route is pleasant to ride on, doesn't have a lot of roads where drivers want to kill you, and is attractive to look at</li>
        <li>They include stops for sightseeing, snacks, premium coffee, and/or light beers</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-6">
        I've personally scouted, ridden, and iterated on every ride here. The routes themselves are
        high-quality, include turn-by-turn directions and POIs, and are regularly updated when I find a flaw or a road change.
        I'm proud of these rides and I hope you have a blast riding them.
      </p>

      <p>
        Anthony Roldan
      </p>

      <h2>About Anthony</h2>

      <p>Anthony is an engineer, cyclist, and fun enthusiast who lives in Somerville, Massachusetts.
      <a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/5603745">Follow me on Strava!</a>
    </p>

      <!-- Add more content here as needed -->
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
